{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Bound cleanup after suspension or retry.** Even after the manager selects `PENDING` or `RETRYING`, this cannot finalize until `invokeHandler` and arbitrary `finally` blocks return. A blocked cleanup can consume the Lambda deadline and prevent the durable response. Race cleanup against the remaining invocation time while reserving finalization/transport budget, and propagate a retryable invocation failure when it expires.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77sbnB","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":128,"observation_digest":"1d05862d86cc7310df7f3386718b13c7768e0af7ab30afe26dc59a48e7e27245","observation_id":"aro_v1_ducymlmgzrzrbx37godhdcyty5","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3ad56x3tucxpdx6v3vndafnqmc","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"40597b3393d2260883ae37b45d978685d2144a31","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_tl35ylfkmrnpghioaohi6okpln","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
